      "side": 1,
      "message": "The understanding of \"you have to modify whatever tools you\u0027re using to accept a path to the Chrome binary\" is correct.  It\u0027s generally an option called `executable_path` or `executablePath` that pass to launch method like:\n\n\n```\nconst browser \u003d await puppeteer.launch({\n  executablePath: process.env.BROWSER_EXECUTABLE_PATH,\n});\n```\n\nHowever it could also supported directly from high level framework like Cypress which has a `--browser` flag when running the tests.",
